'''Pitfalls''' are invulnerable and stationary enemies which Isaac can walk over. When Isaac walks over a pitfall, he falls in, takes damage, and pops back out after a short delay. Pitfalls disappear after falling into them. They are only spawned by several of {{e|Little Horn}}'s attacks.

== Notes ==
* [[Flight]] makes Isaac immune to pitfalls.
{{clear}}
