== Variations ==
=== Suction Pitfall ===
{{infobox entity
 | dlc         = a
 | name        = Suction Pitfall
 | variant     = 1
 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}{{floor|Cellar}}{{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{floor|Sheol}}{{floor|Cathedral}}
 | behavior    = Invulnerable and stationary enemy which sucks Isaac towards itself. Isaac falls into it when walked over, taking damage and popping back out after a short delay.
}}

'''Suction Pitfalls''' act as regular pitfalls, but suck Isaac in like a {{e|Gaping Maw}}. They are typically found in rooms with [[Pressure Plate]]s, which when pressed will make any Suction Pitfalls in the room disappear.
{{clear}}

=== Teleport Pitfall ===
{{infobox entity
 | dlc         = a
 | name        = Teleport Pitfall
 | variant     = 2
 | environment = Only spawned by {{e|Little Horn}}.
 | behavior    = Invulnerable and stationary enemy which Isaac falls into when walked over, taking damage and popping back out at a random location after a short delay.
}}

'''Teleport Pitfalls''' act as regular pitfalls, but pop Isaac out at a random location after damaging him. {{e|Little Horn}} spawns these and pushes them outward in some of his attacks.
{{clear}}

