{{bug|dlc=nr|Using {{i|Spider Mod|n}} will display health bars for Pitfalls.}}
{{bug|dlc=a+nr|Falling into a Pitfall while a {{i|Black Hole}} is active will result in Isaac becoming headless, immobile and invulnerable, softlocking the run until it is quit and resumed.}}
{{bug|dlc=r|If Isaac walks over a Teleport Pitfall while {{i|Mega Mush}} is active a visual bug will occur where the pitfall is destroyed and can no longer harm Isaac however its sprites still remain in the room. When Isaac reenters the room or exits and continues the run, the teleport pitfall works normally again.}}

